2020-08-13 Florian Pein, version 1.1-0

  Added new idealisation methods JSMURF and HILDE:

  * new exports: jsmurf, hilde, createLocalList, improveSmallScales
  
  * new options in getCritVal: arguments family and ...
  
  * package imports lowpassFilter, lowpassFilter is reexported, imported stepR has to be 2.1-0 or newer, depends on R-3.3.0

  * updated DESCRIPTION, CITATION
  
  * added a vignette, suggests R.rsp, vignette builder R.rsp
  
  * minor updates to existing documentation
  
  * minor changes in deconvolveLocally: warning no deconvolution, use of imported .deconvolveJump / .deconvolvePeak

